3. OTHER LOGO IMPLEMENTATIONS
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Lohgo implements the Logo language as documented for Berkeley Logo (UCBLogo,
   by Brian Harvey and others at the University of California, Berkeley) and
   adds commands in the style of MSWLogo and FMSLogo and of LCSI Logo. It was
   written from scratch and contains no code from any of these projects. The
   names of these implementations are used only to describe compatibility.


